SOLUTION 1 DIC
    temp 20
    units mol/kgw
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 0.05
SOLUTION 2 Ca
    temp 20
    units mol/kgw
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 0.05
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
USE mix 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 10
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 38 56 74 92 110 128 146 164 182 200
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected2.out
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -equilibrium_phases Calcite
END
